<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/13/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Solid Waste and Public Cleansing Management Act (Amendment) 2025."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/13/eng@> .
