<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/13/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 108(2) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph (s) the following paragraphs: “(sa) prescribing the type of community service to be performed under a community service order; (sb) prescribing the manner of supervision of the performance of the community service under a community service order;”."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/13/eng@> .
